al temperature control\n- Consumer electronics\n- HVAC systems\nPin Configuration", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 637, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "c6c7463f-11e8-471b-a267-a700171677cf": {"__data__": {"id_": "c6c7463f-11e8-471b-a267-a700171677cf", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"page_label": "2", "file_name": "ZX-101_Temperature_Sensor_Datasheet.pdf", "file_path": "/Users/outdid/Desktop/Work/SEMICONSPACE_AI/backend/data/datasheets/ZX-101_Temperature_Sensor_Datasheet.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 2039, "creation_date": "2025-07-28", "last_modified_date": "2025-07-28"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "e90738f1-f257-43f9-806e-003ff2d2c9ae", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"page_label": "2", "file_name": "ZX-101_Temperature_Sensor_Datasheet.pdf", "file_path": "/Users/outdid/Desktop/Work/SEMICONSPACE_AI/backend/data/datasheets/ZX-101_Temperature_Sensor_Datasheet.pdf", "file_type": "application/pdf", "file_size": 2039, "creation_date": "2025-07-28", "last_modified_date": "2025-07-28"}, "hash": "ef1ea711238103467f6c399d93ec95e35f952fa09e0e83d5642fd40267f2bccf", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "ZX-101 Analog Temperature Sensor\nPin Configuration (TO-92 Package):\n1. VCC (Power Supply)\n2. VOUT (Analog Voltage Output)\n3. GND (Ground)", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 137, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "00fd21da-34e7-4d50-a988-9d42729b00e0": {"__data__": {"id_": "00fd21